        "title": "The oldest Shiva temple, must visit for Hindus",
        "text": "Pashupatinath Temple is considered a very holy place for the Hindus, and it was truly a blessing for me to have visited the temple.\n\nMake sure you visit in the morning between 9:30-10:30 to see the Lord from all 4 Doors, if you visit in the evening you will get to see only through one.\n\nUnfortunately non-Hindus are not allowed inside the temple, you can see from outside or see from the backyard. You can visit there in the evening between 6-7:30 when there is live devotional music(satsang) played and Aarti is taken.",
